  ('Instructor', 'AU', "G'day, Coral Bay Dive Centre, Ryan speaking."),
  ('Caller', 'GB', "Oh, hello. I'm coming to Coral Bay on holiday next month, and I'd love to learn to dive while I'm there. Could you tell me about your courses for beginners?"),
